@startuml COM2_Enterprise_UseCases

title COM2 — Enterprise Viewpoint — Service Use Case

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Interaction Submitter" as Submitter

rectangle "COM2 Service" {

  usecase "UC-COM2-01\nSubmit Interaction\nfor Admission" as Submit
}

Submitter --> Submit

note right of Submit

Enterprise intent:

Submit an identifiable interaction
for controlled admission and obtain
an explicit admission outcome.

Possible outcomes:

- accepted as an interaction envelope;
- rejected.

Applicable Service Guarantees:

G-COM2-01
Controlled Interaction Admission

G-COM2-02
Explicit Admission Outcome

G-COM2-03
Interaction Identity Preservation

G-COM2-04
Optional Interaction Information

end note

@enduml
